      "type": "text",
      "content": "{\"v\": 1, \"blocks\": [{\"t\": \"lead\", \"text\": \"Earl Nightingale's core truth: “We become what we think about.” Your mind is the architect of your reality.\"}, {\"t\": \"kv\", \"items\": [{\"k\": \"Negative thoughts\", \"v\": \"Negative outcomes — a scarcity mindset\"}, {\"k\": \"Positive thoughts\", \"v\": \"Positive outcomes — more deals\"}]}, {\"t\": \"callout\", \"title\": \"The 30-day challenge\", \"text\": \"Control your thoughts for 30 days. Catch every scarcity thought and replace it with the outcome you want.\"}]}",
