      "content": "{\"v\": 1, \"quiz\": {\"title\": \"Module 1 Quiz: Mindset\", \"passPct\": 70, \"questions\": [{\"q\": \"What is the core philosophy behind the Crea'fi mindset?\", \"choices\": [\"Deals are won on price alone\", \"We become what we think about\", \"Only distressed sellers matter\", \"Luck decides your results\"], \"answer\": 1}, {\"q\": \"Why can't you attract high-value deals with a scarcity mindset?\", \"choices\": [\"Because you attract what you vibrate, not just what you want\", \"Because wealthy sellers avoid new investors\", \"Because scarcity lowers your commission\", \"You actually can — mindset is irrelevant\"], \"answer\": 0}, {\"q\": \"According to the 1% rule, how do you build success?\", \"choices\": [\"One big transformation\", \"Get 1% better every single day\", \"Wait for the perfect market\", \"Make one call a week\"], \"answer\": 1}, {\"q\": \"“Faith without works is dead” means…\", \"choices\": [\"Belief alone closes deals\", \"Skip the work if you believe hard enough\", \"Belief must be paired with consistent daily action\", \"Works matter, faith does not\"], \"answer\": 2}]}}",
