      "id": "les-m7-am3",
      "moduleId": "mod-creafi-7",
      "communityId": "creafi",
      "courseId": "creafi-way",
      "title": "Acquisitions Method — Cheat Sheet",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "{\"v\": 1, \"blocks\": [{\"t\": \"lead\", \"text\": \"The whole method on one page. Drill it until you can't get it wrong.\"}, {\"t\": \"kv\", \"items\": [{\"k\": \"Before the call\", \"v\": \"Act as if; be curious, skeptical, unattached; make them feel safe. They talk 70%.\"}, {\"k\": \"The flow\", \"v\": \"Bond → up-front contract → pain → terms → decision → fulfillment/close → post-sell. Seal each before the next.\"}, {\"k\": \"The gates\", \"v\": \"No pain, no money/terms, no decision = no deal. Qualify hard.\"}, {\"k\": \"Pain\", \"v\": \"Surface → impact → personal; first answers are smoke screens, dig to the emotional word.\"}, {\"k\": \"Reverse\", \"v\": \"Never answer an unasked question; one short line, then turn it back; rotate your reverses.\"}, {\"k\": \"Terms\", \"v\": \"Willingness > ability; fight on terms, not price; “would the how matter if it got you your number?”\"}, {\"k\": \"Money\", \"v\": \"Talk it early; “share the round numbers”; more pain = more movement.\"}, {\"k\": \"Decision\", \"v\": \"Who else is on title / in the decision? Find them now.\"}, {\"k\": \"Close\", \"v\": \"Present with their numbers → read the 0–10 → let them state the next step → binding number to the human.\"}, {\"k\": \"Post-sell\", \"v\": \"Rehearse them against the higher offer and the family voice before you leave.\"}]}, {\"t\": \"callout\", \"title\": \"Golden rule\", \"text\": \"Ask, don't tell. The one asking the questions is in control. Teach the method, then drill it until they can't get it wrong — you can't teach a kid to ride a bike at a seminar. It takes reps.\"}]}",
      "summary": "The whole method on one page for quick reference before a call.",
